---
---
<div class="dual">
  <a class="dual-card tenant" href="#properties">
    <span class="badge">For 房客</span>
    <h3>找一間，可以好好住下來的房子。</h3>
    <p>瀏覽目前可入住的物件，看房不收費、合約透明。</p>
    <span class="go">
      看可入住物件
      <span class="arrow">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="ornament"></span>
  </a>
  <a class="dual-card landlord" href="#contact">
    <span class="badge">For 房東</span>
    <h3>把空房，換成穩定的月入。</h3>
    <p>包租或代管方案皆可，租務瑣事交給奕德，您只負責收款。</p>
    <span class="go">
      聯絡託管諮詢
      <span class="arrow">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="ornament"></span>
  </a>
</div>

<style is:global>
/* dual entry */
.dual{
  margin-top: 56px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}
@media (max-width: 720px){ .dual{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.dual-card{
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: var(--r-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--hairline-soft);
  transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
}
.dual-card:hover{ transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
.dual-card .badge{
  align-self: flex-start;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  border-radius: var(--r-pill);
}
.dual-card h3{
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 30px;
  margin: 0;
  letter-spacing: -.3px;
  line-height: 1.12;
}
.dual-card p{ margin: 0; color: var(--body); font-size: 15px; }
.dual-card .go{
  margin-top: 8px;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.dual-card .go .arrow{
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  width: 28px; height: 28px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ink); color: var(--canvas);
  transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease;
}
.dual-card:hover .go .arrow{ background: var(--accent); transform: translateX(4px); }
.dual-card.landlord{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--canvas); border-color: var(--ink); }
.dual-card.landlord .badge{ border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.2); color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
.dual-card.landlord p{ color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
.dual-card.landlord .go{ color: var(--canvas); }
.dual-card.landlord .go .arrow{ background: var(--accent); }
.dual-card > *{ position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.dual-card .ornament{
  position: absolute; right: -90px; bottom: -90px;
  width: 220px; height: 220px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, var(--accent-soft), transparent 55%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}
.dual-card.landlord .ornament{
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--accent) 28%, transparent), transparent 55%);
}
</style>
